You don't put a soft cheese next to a hard cheese.
你不能把软芝士放在硬芝士旁边。

1130
00:48:41.600 --> 00:48:42.900
I was making a smiley face.
我在做一个笑脸。

1131
00:48:43.180 --> 00:48:43.700
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1132
00:48:44.120 --> 00:48:44.300
Okay.
好吧。

