我可不这么认为。

1138
00:48:58.910 --> 00:48:59.290
All right.
好吧。

1139
00:48:59.450 --> 00:48:59.750
Okay.
好吧。

1140
00:48:59.790 --> 00:49:00.910
You know a lot about cheeses.
你对芝士了解得真多。

1141
00:49:01.070 --> 00:49:03.310
I just, I've already started.
我只是，我已经开始了。

1142
00:49:03.430 --> 00:49:04.370
I'll just, all right.
我只会，好吧。

1143
00:49:05.150 --> 00:49:05.790
Oh, hey.
哦，嘿。

1144
00:49:06.510 --> 00:49:08.090
What do you think I should say if I get caught?
如果我被抓到了，你觉得我该说些什么？

1145
00:49:11.480 --> 00:49:13.960
First of all, it's a foolproof plan.
首先，这是一个万无一失的计划。

1146
00:49:14.180 --> 00:49:14.640
I know.
我知道。

1147
00:49:14.960 --> 00:49:18.020
But, uh, if something were to happen.
但是，呃，如果真发生了什么事。

1148
00:49:18.300 --> 00:49:18.860
What should I say?
我该说些什么？

1149
00:49:19.660 --> 00:49:20.520
Cart, cart.
推车，推车。

1150
00:49:22.180 --> 00:49:22.980
I got it.
我知道了。

1151
00:49:26.110 --> 00:49:26.790
Pulled in me.
拉住我了。

1152
00:49:27.190 --> 00:49:28.270
Do you have any gray poop on?
你身上有灰 Poupon 芥末吗？

1153
00:49:28.350 --> 00:49:28.570
Yes.
有。

1154
00:49:28.910 --> 00:49:31.030
I will use the gray poop on line.
我要在线上使用灰 Poupon。

1155
00:49:33.220 --> 00:49:34.540
Now I sort of want to get caught.
我现在有点想被抓个正着。

1156
00:49:37.320 --> 00:49:41.040
Okay, first of all, Andy was a fromageier apprentice.
好吧，首先，安迪曾是个奶酪学徒。

1157
00:49:41.420 --> 00:49:41.680
Yeah.
是啊。

1158
00:49:42.220 --> 00:49:44.720
Second of all, the gray poop on.
其次，那个灰 Poupon。

1159
00:49:44.720 --> 00:49:47.140
Aw, don't you wish that had happened?
天哪，你不希望当时发生了那种事吗？

1160
00:49:47.140 --> 00:49:48.600
I kind of needed it to happen.
我某种程度上需要它发生。

1161
00:49:48.820 --> 00:49:50.600
I totally remember those commercials.
我完全记得那些广告。

1162
00:49:50.960 --> 00:49:54.180
I did too, which sent me down a rabbit hole last night.
我也是，这让我昨晚陷入了一个疯狂搜索的深渊。

1163
00:49:54.400 --> 00:49:55.380
You remember, guys?
你们还记得吗，伙计们？

1164
00:49:55.580 --> 00:49:59.640
They were a long time ago, but there would be sort of a very elegant, refined gentleman
那是很久以前的事了，会有那种非常优雅、精致的绅士

1165
00:49:59.640 --> 00:50:03.420
in a Rolls Royce eating an elaborate sandwich with gray poop on.
坐在劳斯莱斯里吃着抹了灰 Poupon 的精致三明治。

1166
00:50:03.540 --> 00:50:04.580
In the back of his car.
在他的豪车后座上。

1167
00:50:04.760 --> 00:50:06.220
Yeah, like on a little mini tray.
对，就像在一个小迷你托盘上。

1168
00:50:06.400 --> 00:50:06.620
Yes.
是的。

1169
00:50:06.700 --> 00:50:10.340
Like as if he was on an airplane in like an English countryside.
就像他在英国乡村的飞机上一样。

1170
00:50:10.680 --> 00:50:14.460
And another Rolls Royce with another older distinguished gentleman would pull up
然后另一辆劳斯莱斯载着另一位年长的尊贵绅士驶来

1171
00:50:14.460 --> 00:50:15.940
and they would say this.
他们会这么说。

1172
00:50:16.680 --> 00:50:17.420
Pardon me?
打扰一下？

1173
00:50:17.960 --> 00:50:20.220
Would you have any gray poop on?
请问你有灰 Poupon 吗？

1174
00:50:21.740 --> 00:50:22.500
But of course.
当然有。

1175
00:50:24.380 --> 00:50:29.940
So, of course, that wasn't where I stopped, Jenna, with my gray poop on research.
所以，珍娜，我关于灰 Poupon 的研究当然没停在那里。

1176
00:50:30.260 --> 00:50:30.310
Of course not.
当然没有。

1177
00:50:30.420 --> 00:50:31.380
I would hope not.
我希望没有。

1178
00:50:32.200 --> 00:50:34.220
I had to go to the gray poop on website.
我不得不去看了灰 Poupon 的网站。

1179
00:50:34.460 --> 00:50:37.880
And there's a lot of fascinating things about gray poop on.
关于灰 Poupon 有很多迷人的事情。

1180
00:50:38.280 --> 00:50:39.840
Did you know it was made with wine?
你知道它是用葡萄酒酿造的吗？

1181
00:50:40.560 --> 00:50:41.080
No.
不知道。

1182
00:50:41.080 --> 00:50:41.900
Yes.
是的。

1183
00:50:42.440 --> 00:50:47.560
And not only that, did you know that gray poop on made a wine?
不仅如此，你知道灰 Poupon 还出产过一款葡萄酒吗？

1184
00:50:48.360 --> 00:50:49.460
Wait, what?
等等，什么？

1185
00:50:49.740 --> 00:50:50.120
Yes.
是的。

1186
00:50:50.240 --> 00:50:52.900
They're a winemaker and a fancy mustard maker?
他们既是酿酒商又是高级芥末制造商？

1187
00:50:53.100 --> 00:50:56.280
They make fancy mustard, but they decided to feature a white wine.
他们制作高级芥末，但他们决定推出一款白葡萄酒。

1188
00:50:56.420 --> 00:51:00.040
It was called La Moutarde Vin, probably saying it wrong.
它叫做 La Moutarde Vin，我可能发音不对。

1189
00:51:00.480 --> 00:51:03.500
And it was inspired by their gray poop on mustard.
它是从他们的灰 Poupon 芥末中获得灵感的。

1190
00:51:04.060 --> 00:51:06.740
Here is how the wine is described, Jenna.
珍娜，这款酒是这样描述的。

1191
00:51:07.120 --> 00:51:07.580
Are you ready?
准备好了吗？

1192
00:51:08.000 --> 00:51:08.340
Yes.
准备好了。

1193
00:51:08.340 --> 00:51:15.560
It's bright hints of spice, pronounced citrus, floral characteristics balanced by vibrant
它有着明亮的香料气息、明显的柑橘味、花香特征，并与充满活力的酸度相平衡

1194
00:51:15.560 --> 00:51:22.540
acidity with the typical texture and roundness on the palate you'd expect from a Vognier.
同时在口感上具有维欧尼所期望的典型质感和圆润度。

1195
00:51:23.060 --> 00:51:24.220
Probably saying that wrong.
我大概又读错发音了。

1196
00:51:24.760 --> 00:51:25.620
So, guess what?
所以，你猜怎么着？

1197
00:51:26.020 --> 00:51:26.520
What?
什么？

1198
00:51:26.680 --> 00:51:28.200
I thought we both needed a bottle.
我觉得我们俩都需要一瓶。

1199
00:51:28.320 --> 00:51:28.680
What?
什么？

1200
00:51:28.860 --> 00:51:29.320
What?
什么？

1201
00:51:29.320 --> 00:51:33.760
And I tried to buy the gray poop on white wine, and it sold out.
而且我试图买白葡萄酒配灰 Poupon 芥末酱，结果卖光了。

1202
00:51:34.120 --> 00:51:35.020
Oh, my God.
哦，天哪。

1203
00:51:35.020 --> 00:51:39.120
I am going to tell you right now that I have never in my life craved more.
我现在就告诉你们，我这辈子从来没有这么渴望过。

1204
00:51:39.340 --> 00:51:42.920
A sandwich with gray poop on mustard and a glass of their mustard wine.
一份加了灰 Poupon 芥末酱的黄芥末三明治，再来一杯他们的芥末葡萄酒。

1205
00:51:43.360 --> 00:51:43.800
What?
什么？

1206
00:51:44.400 --> 00:51:45.660
I need it now.
我现在就要。

1207
00:51:45.940 --> 00:51:47.200
Well, I'm going to keep trying to buy it.
好吧，我会继续尝试买到它。

1208
00:51:47.200 --> 00:51:49.400
You had me so excited, and now I am so sad.
你刚才让我那么兴奋，现在我却这么难过。

1209
00:51:49.400 --> 00:51:54.440
I'm going to keep trying to buy it, because even as I read the description of the white
我还会继续试着买，因为当我读到那款白葡萄酒的描述时

1210
00:51:54.440 --> 00:52:00.620
wine inspired by gray poop on mustard, it sounded like Andy describing the cheese cart.
它号称是从灰 Poupon 芥末酱中汲取灵感，听起来就像安迪在描述芝士推车。

1211
00:52:01.220 --> 00:52:05.180
I mean, with a typical texture and roundness on the palate.
我的意思是，具有典型的质感和圆润的口感。

1212
00:52:06.420 --> 00:52:06.980
Wow.
哇。

1213
00:52:06.980 --> 00:52:11.700
And that wraps up the cheese cart, Deleted Scene Runner.
以上就是关于芝士推车的删减片段彩蛋。

1214
00:52:12.260 --> 00:52:17.600
I'd like to share with everyone for you, Angela, that you love cheese.
安吉拉，我想替大家说出这一点，你真的很爱芝士。

1215
00:52:17.820 --> 00:52:18.660
I love cheese.
我太爱芝士了。

1216
00:52:18.900 --> 00:52:24.840
When we went out to dinner in New York, where we were celebrating our billboard in Times Square.
当我们在纽约出去吃晚餐时，我们在那里庆祝时代广场的巨幅广告牌。

1217
00:52:24.980 --> 00:52:26.080
200 million downloads.
2亿次下载。

1218
00:52:26.320 --> 00:52:27.040
So amazing.
太棒了。

1219
00:52:27.900 --> 00:52:34.220
We went to dinner, and on the menu, one of the options is a cheese plate with fancy cheeses.
我们去吃晚饭，菜单上的选项之一是带有高级芝士的芝士拼盘。

1220
00:52:34.580 --> 00:52:36.420
Yes, several different kinds you can pick.
对，你可以挑选好几种不同的。

1221
00:52:37.320 --> 00:52:39.140
And this is Angela reading the menu.
这是安吉拉在读菜单的场景。

1222
00:52:39.320 --> 00:52:40.380
I'm going to be Angela reading the menu.
我要模仿安吉拉读菜单。

1223
00:52:41.120 --> 00:52:42.160
Well, I definitely want cheese.
嗯，我绝对想吃芝士。

1224
00:52:42.560 --> 00:52:45.920
I don't know what else I want, but I'm going to need to get cheese.
我不知道我还想吃什么，但我得来点芝士。

1225
00:52:46.800 --> 00:52:47.960
What do you want to start?
你想先点什么？

1226
00:52:48.280 --> 00:52:49.020
Do you want some cheeses?
你想来点芝士吗？

1227
00:52:49.340 --> 00:52:50.400
I want some cheeses.
我想来点芝士。

1228
00:52:51.220 --> 00:52:52.500
Ugh, I don't know.
呃，我不知道。

1229
00:52:53.240 --> 00:52:55.260
Then you were like, should we have cheeses after?
然后你说，我们要不要饭后再吃芝士？

1230
00:52:55.260 --> 00:52:57.220
I said, how about cheese as like a dessert course?
我说，把芝士当作甜点怎么样？

1231
00:52:57.220 --> 00:52:57.480
Yeah.
对。

1232
00:52:57.620 --> 00:53:00.000
Because we were hungry, and we wanted a bunch of food.
因为我们很饿，而且想点一堆吃的。

1233
00:53:00.120 --> 00:53:00.280
Yeah.
对。

1234
00:53:00.400 --> 00:53:04.560
And I said, why don't we see how we feel at the end, and maybe we get cheese as dessert
我说，不如我们看看吃到最后感觉怎么样，也许我们可以把芝士当作甜点

1235
00:53:04.560 --> 00:53:05.000
and wine.
还有葡萄酒。

1236
00:53:05.000 --> 00:53:06.340
That's the way they do it in Europe.
欧洲人就是这么吃的。

1237
00:53:06.420 --> 00:53:06.960
Right, right.
对的，对的。

1238
00:53:06.960 --> 00:53:07.820
You end with cheese.
最后以芝士收尾。

1239
00:53:07.980 --> 00:53:08.140
Right.
对。

1240
00:53:08.580 --> 00:53:11.840
Well, we ate, and the restaurant was so kind to us.
好吧，我们吃过了，餐厅对我们非常好。

1241
00:53:11.900 --> 00:53:14.180
They brought us an extra appetizer on the house.
他们免费送了我们一份开胃菜。

1242
00:53:14.320 --> 00:53:15.760
They were Office Ladies fans.
他们是《办公室女士》的粉丝。

1243
00:53:16.120 --> 00:53:16.420
Yeah.
对。

1244
00:53:16.820 --> 00:53:17.520
And then?
然后呢？

1245
00:53:17.800 --> 00:53:19.380
We had big hearty pasta.
我们吃了丰盛浓郁的意面。

1246
00:53:19.980 --> 00:53:21.560
We were too full for cheese.
我们饱得吃不下芝士了。

1247
00:53:21.780 --> 00:53:27.080
And I watched Angela get real sad when she realized that she would not be ordering cheese.
我看着安吉拉意识到自己点不了芝士时，露出了非常伤心的表情。

1248
00:53:27.280 --> 00:53:28.460
This woman loves cheese.
这个女人太爱芝士了。

1249
00:53:28.640 --> 00:53:29.360
I love cheese.
我太爱芝士了。

1250
00:53:29.360 --> 00:53:30.640
I love all kinds of cheese.
我爱所有种类的芝士。

1251
00:53:30.960 --> 00:53:38.320
I once bought a super stinky cheese that my family asked me to put in the garage because
我曾经买过一块超级臭的奶酪，我的家人让我把它放进车库，因为

1252
00:53:38.320 --> 00:53:41.060
it had stunk up our fridge so bad.
它把我们的冰箱熏得太臭了。

1253
00:53:41.200 --> 00:53:44.620
And when I would take it out to eat it, literally, the kids were like, ugh.
而且当我把它拿出来吃的时候，说实话，孩子们都一副“呃”的表情。

1254
00:53:45.880 --> 00:53:46.660
All right, guys.
好了，各位。

1255
00:53:46.660 --> 00:53:48.500
We got a little off topic, but-
我们有点偏离主题了，不过——

1256
00:53:48.500 --> 00:53:49.180
Who, us?
谁，我们？

1257
00:53:49.300 --> 00:53:49.540
No.
没有。

1258
00:53:49.820 --> 00:53:50.680
But forgive us.
但请原谅我们。

1259
00:53:50.680 --> 00:53:51.480
It was cheese.
那是奶酪。

1260
00:53:51.760 --> 00:53:54.920
If anything's going to take us off topic, it's going to be cheese.
如果有什么能让我们偏离主题，那一定非奶酪莫属。

1261
00:53:55.020 --> 00:53:55.260
Cheese.
奶酪。

1262
00:53:55.500 --> 00:53:58.700
And then when you find out a fancy mustard made of wine, come on.
然后当你发现还有用葡萄酒做的高档芥末时，拜托。

1263
00:53:58.700 --> 00:54:00.220
