1412
01:01:41.920 --> 01:01:50.000
but I think a podcast about a show set in Scranton is the perfect listening choice while preparing for a race that ends in Scranton.
但我认为，在准备一场终点设在斯兰顿的比赛时，听一个背景设在斯兰顿的节目的播客，简直是绝佳的选择。

1413
01:01:50.240 --> 01:01:52.080
Aw, Greg, I love that.
噢，格雷格，我太喜欢了。

1414
01:01:52.240 --> 01:01:54.040
Greg, I hope you're running right now.
格雷格，我希望你现在正在跑步。

1415
01:01:54.140 --> 01:01:54.420
Hello.
你好。

1416
01:01:54.760 --> 01:01:55.160
Hello.
你好。

1417
01:01:55.520 --> 01:01:56.220
How's it going?
最近怎么样？

1418
01:01:56.560 --> 01:02:00.560
I hope you're hydrated and have really comfortable running shoes.
我希望你补充了水分，并且穿着非常舒适的跑鞋。

1419
01:02:00.800 --> 01:02:01.420
Keep going.
坚持下去。

1420
01:02:01.620 --> 01:02:02.100
Keep going.
坚持下去。

1421
01:02:02.300 --> 01:02:03.000
You can do it.
你能行的。

1422
01:02:03.760 --> 01:02:05.540
Pep Talks by Jenna and Angela.
詹娜和安吉拉的打气时间。

1423
01:02:05.800 --> 01:02:06.000
Yeah.
是啊。

1424
01:02:06.920 --> 01:02:08.840
David's going to ask Jim to walk him to his car.
大卫要让吉姆送他到车那儿去。

1425
01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:10.700
I think this is never a good thing, guys.
我觉得这绝对不是什么好事，伙计们。

1426
01:02:10.960 --> 01:02:13.380
I think if someone says, hey, can you walk me to my car?
我觉得如果有人说，嘿，你能送我到车那儿吗？

1427
01:02:13.520 --> 01:02:14.740
They're going to tell you something.
他们肯定有话要对你讲。

1428
01:02:15.380 --> 01:02:15.740
Yeah.
是啊。

1429
01:02:15.820 --> 01:02:17.100
Some shiitake's going to go down.
肯定要发生什么破事了。

1430
01:02:17.360 --> 01:02:17.600
Yeah.
是啊。

1431
01:02:18.000 --> 01:02:22.860
And when Jim comes back in the office, he's clearly bummed by whatever it is David said to him.
当吉姆回到办公室时，不管大卫对他说什么，他显然都沮丧极了。

1432
01:02:23.100 --> 01:02:25.420
Yeah, Michael tries to bring him some jelly beans.
是啊，迈克尔试着拿一些果冻豆给他。

1433
01:02:25.420 --> 01:02:33.020
And I want you to know, he's definitely bummed because at 13 minutes, 50 seconds, he's taken off his jacket.
我想让你们知道，他绝对是沮丧透了，因为在13分50秒的时候，他脱掉了外套。

1434
01:02:33.560 --> 01:02:34.160
Aw.
噢。

1435
01:02:34.340 --> 01:02:37.680
His ambition jacket, as I like to call it.
我喜欢把它叫做他的雄心夹克。

1436
01:02:38.080 --> 01:02:40.780
I think his ambition has been deflated.
我觉得他的雄心壮志泄气了。

1437
01:02:41.200 --> 01:02:41.560
Aw.
噢。

1438
01:02:41.880 --> 01:02:42.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1439
01:02:42.060 --> 01:02:43.420
Ambition jacket.
雄心夹克。

1440
01:02:43.820 --> 01:02:44.020
Yeah.
是啊。

1441
01:02:44.800 --> 01:02:46.800
So they're going to go into Michael's office.
所以他们要走进迈克尔的办公室。

1442
01:02:47.000 --> 01:02:49.880
Jim is like, I need to find out what you told David Wallace.
吉姆就像是，我得弄清楚你对大卫·华莱士说了什么。

1443
01:02:50.480 --> 01:02:57.640
I'd also like to point out that as they walk into Michael's office, I still have my binder on my desk that I've been working on.
我还想指出的是，当他们走进迈克尔的办公室时，我的桌上依然放着我一直在做的那个文件夹。

1444
01:02:57.760 --> 01:02:59.440
I've been working on that binder all day.
我一整天都在弄那个文件夹。

1445
01:03:00.160 --> 01:03:01.240
And you know what, guys?
你知道吗，伙计们？

1446
01:03:01.380 --> 01:03:02.240
She really did.
她确实一直在弄。

1447
01:03:02.400 --> 01:03:06.340
By the end of this episode, Pam would have had a stellar binder thanks to Jenna.
到了这集结束时，多亏了詹娜，帕姆会拥有一个非常棒的文件夹。

1448
01:03:06.480 --> 01:03:06.600
Yeah.
是啊。

1449
01:03:06.740 --> 01:03:09.320
I don't know what the binder is about, but it's going to be great.
我不知道这个文件夹是做什么用的，但它肯定很棒。

1450
01:03:09.980 --> 01:03:11.100
Toby's not looking so good.
托比看起来气色不太好。

1451
01:03:11.500 --> 01:03:14.640
Dwight is checking his pupils to see if they're dilated.
德怀特正在检查他们的瞳孔，看看有没有放大。

1452
01:03:14.780 --> 01:03:16.760
He's got a big red mark on his forehead.
他额头上有一个大红印。

1453
01:03:16.920 --> 01:03:17.100
Yep.
没错。

1454
01:03:17.100 --> 01:03:21.940
And Daryl busts in and is like, hey, you called my sister an a-hole.
然后达里尔冲了进来，就像是，嘿，你叫我姐混蛋。

1455
01:03:22.140 --> 01:03:24.160
You drove into my trash cans.
你撞坏了我的垃圾桶。

1456
01:03:24.420 --> 01:03:25.280
He's ticked off.
他气炸了。

1457
01:03:25.500 --> 01:03:25.700
Yeah.
对。

1458
01:03:25.940 --> 01:03:28.080
Daryl wants to call corporate and file a complaint.
达里尔想找公司人事投诉并备案。

1459
01:03:28.820 --> 01:03:30.220
Guys, guest star alert.
伙计们，客串明星警报。

1460
01:03:30.380 --> 01:03:33.140
Daryl's sister, Gwyneth, was played by Jamila Jackson.
达里尔的姐姐格温妮丝由贾米拉·杰克逊饰演。

1461
01:03:33.140 --> 01:03:34.220
She is so good.
她太棒了。

1462
01:03:34.380 --> 01:03:35.960
She is so good in this scene.
她在这场戏里演得真好。

1463
01:03:36.100 --> 01:03:36.440
Perfect.
太完美了。

1464
01:03:36.780 --> 01:03:39.280
She's going to appear in another episode as well.
她还会在另一集中出现。

1465
01:03:39.280 --> 01:03:48.640
And Randy Cordray told us that after they cast her, she agreed to let Debbie Pierce cut her hair to match Craig for this role.
兰迪·科德雷告诉我们，确定人选后，她同意让黛比·皮尔斯为了这个角色剪短头发，以配合克雷格的造型。

1466
01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:50.460
Well, it really sold it.
嗯，这真的很加分。

1467
01:03:50.660 --> 01:03:52.240
I mean, that's commitment.
我是说，这就是敬业。

1468
01:03:52.460 --> 01:03:53.440
That's actor commitment.
这就是演员的敬业精神。

1469
01:03:53.660 --> 01:03:54.200
It is.
确实是。

1470
01:03:54.340 --> 01:03:56.260
And sometimes you get asked to do that stuff.
有时候你会遇到这种要求。

1471
01:03:56.260 --> 01:04:03.100
Yeah, I remember they would put that in the breakdowns for roles if there was, like, something you needed to do.
对，我记得如果有什么需要完成的事情，剧组会在角色通告里写明。

1472
01:04:03.560 --> 01:04:08.500
Like, I don't know, shave your head or grow a beard or...
比如，我不知道，剃光头或者留胡子之类……

1473
01:04:08.500 --> 01:04:11.840
Dye your hair dark, dark brown like I did for Haters Back Off.
把头发染成深棕色，就像我拍《讨厌的人滚开》时那样。

1474
01:04:11.940 --> 01:04:12.240
Yes.
没错。

1475
01:04:12.320 --> 01:04:15.000
I was a full brunette for two years.
我当了两年的纯深色头发。

1476
01:04:15.280 --> 01:04:15.500
Yep.
对。

1477
01:04:15.780 --> 01:04:16.860
Freaked my family out.
吓坏了我的家人。

1478
01:04:18.100 --> 01:04:21.680
Well, Jamila, thanks for doing that because we loved you as Daryl's sister.
总之，贾米拉，谢谢你这么做，因为我们太喜欢你演的达里尔的姐姐了。

1479
01:04:22.340 --> 01:04:25.080
Dwight and Toby are going to have to go down to the warehouse.
德怀特和托比不得不去仓库一趟。

1480
01:04:25.280 --> 01:04:26.460
They're going to apologize.
他们要去道歉。

1481
01:04:27.160 --> 01:04:36.000
But then Dwight notices that some of the other warehouse workers are using the lift to get down from the top of the stairs.
但接着德怀特发现其他一些仓库员工用升降机从楼梯顶部下来。

1482
01:04:36.180 --> 01:04:42.400
Instead of the stairs, they're, like, crawling through the banister on top of the lift and then going and going down.
他们没有走楼梯，而是像那样从栏杆爬到升降机顶部，然后下去。

1483
01:04:42.400 --> 01:04:44.180
And Dwight's, like, hold on.
然后德怀特就说，等等。

1484
01:04:44.540 --> 01:04:50.160
I think you hurt your leg using the lift instead of the stairs.
我觉得你用升降机而不是楼梯把腿弄伤了。

1485
01:04:50.180 --> 01:04:51.200
And here's my evidence.
这就是我的证据。

1486
01:04:51.380 --> 01:04:53.060
There's this new piece of wood up there.
上面有块新木板。

1487
01:04:53.180 --> 01:04:53.520
Right.
没错。

1488
01:04:54.100 --> 01:04:54.620
Shenanigans.
胡闹。

1489
01:04:54.900 --> 01:04:55.420
Busted.
抓个正着。

1490
01:04:56.240 --> 01:04:57.260
Dwight is right.
德怀特是对的。

1491
01:04:57.820 --> 01:04:59.180
Daryl's, like, uh, yeah.
达里尔就说，呃，好吧。

1492
01:04:59.880 --> 01:05:05.080
So Dwight is, like, I'm going to file a complaint because Daryl lied.
所以德怀特就说，我要去投诉，因为达里尔撒谎了。

1493
01:05:05.580 --> 01:05:09.460
Daryl is, like, I'm going to file a complaint because you harassed my sister.
达里尔就说，我要去投诉，因为你骚扰了我姐。

1494
01:05:10.180 --> 01:05:11.960
Toby is, like, no paperwork.
托比说，别搞那些文件了。

1495
01:05:11.960 --> 01:05:13.420
We're all just going to move on.
大家就此翻篇吧。

1496
01:05:13.840 --> 01:05:19.940
There's an epic stare down between Daryl, his sister, and Dwight.
达里尔、他姐姐和德怀特之间有一场史诗般的对视。

1497
01:05:20.360 --> 01:05:27.960
And it ends with Toby at his desk being, like, so Dwight and Daryl decided to file complaints on one another.
最后镜头切到托比坐在办公桌前说，所以德怀特和达里尔决定互相投诉对方。

1498
01:05:27.960 --> 01:05:30.400
So now Toby is in a mountain of paperwork.
所以现在托比面对堆积如山的文件。

1499
01:05:30.740 --> 01:05:35.640
With his red, like, forehead from running into trash cans.
额头上还带着因为撞垃圾桶留下的红印。

1500
01:05:35.720 --> 01:05:37.220
And his little stuffed doggie.
还有他那个小毛绒狗狗。

1501
01:05:37.360 --> 01:05:37.800
Toby.
托比。

1502
01:05:38.620 --> 01:05:39.280
All right.
好吧。

1503
01:05:39.360 --> 01:05:41.720
Well, we have one more storyline to wrap up here.
嗯，我们这里还有一个故事线要收尾。

1504
01:05:42.340 --> 01:05:53.680
Michael is going to call David Wallace in front of Jim and try to both save his own ass and tell David Wallace that he thinks that Jim is a good person for this promotion.
迈克尔当着吉姆的面给大卫·华莱士打电话，既想保住自己的饭碗，又得告诉大卫·华莱士他觉得吉姆很适合这次升职。

1505
01:05:53.680 --> 01:05:56.920
Jim makes him put David on speakerphone.
吉姆让他把大卫的电话调成免提。

1506
01:05:57.860 --> 01:06:00.860
And he lies at first and says Jim is not there.
他一开始撒了谎，说吉姆不在。

1507
01:06:01.060 --> 01:06:03.940
And then David is, like, I want Jim to be there.
然后大卫说，我希望吉姆也在。

1508
01:06:04.000 --> 01:06:05.960
So he does, like, this funny little, like, oh.
于是他做出了这样一个有趣的小动作，哦。

1509
01:06:06.100 --> 01:06:07.000
He's walking in.
他走进来了。

1510
01:06:07.180 --> 01:06:07.900
Here he is.
他在这儿。

1511
01:06:08.040 --> 01:06:08.640
Oh, hey.
哦，嘿。

1512
01:06:08.640 --> 01:06:09.760
He's sitting down.
他坐下了。

1513
01:06:10.480 --> 01:06:12.320
Well, I had to look it up in the script.
嗯，我得去剧本里查一下。

1514
01:06:12.480 --> 01:06:14.740
I wanted to know, did Steve improvise that in the moment?
我想知道，这是史蒂夫当时即兴发挥的吗？

1515
01:06:15.160 --> 01:06:16.380
That was in the script.
那是剧本里写好的。

1516
01:06:16.580 --> 01:06:17.420
It was so funny.
太搞笑了。

1517
01:06:17.620 --> 01:06:18.640
Steve did it so well.
史蒂夫演得太棒了。

1518
01:06:19.240 --> 01:06:23.980
But also in this scene, Angela, David says, hey, I talked to Alan.
但在这一幕里，安吉拉，大卫说，嘿，我和艾伦聊过了。

1519
01:06:24.440 --> 01:06:28.920
And we had this idea that you guys would become, like, co-managers.
我们有个想法，就是你们俩当联席经理。

1520
01:06:29.680 --> 01:06:32.920
Michael, you're going to handle, like, the sort of big picture stuff.
迈克尔，你负责那种宏观层面的事情。

1521
01:06:33.120 --> 01:06:34.560
Jim, you handle the day-to-day.
吉姆，你负责日常事务。

1522
01:06:34.720 --> 01:06:35.700
What do you think?
你觉得怎么样？

1523
01:06:36.260 --> 01:06:37.860
And Michael's like, I don't know.
迈克尔就说，我不知道。

1524
01:06:38.100 --> 01:06:41.160
And David's like, listen, this is the only way I could sell it to Alan.
然后大卫说，听着，这是我能说服艾伦的唯一方法。

1525
01:06:41.480 --> 01:06:42.260
Who's Alan?
艾伦是谁？

1526
01:06:42.340 --> 01:06:43.060
Who is Alan?
艾伦是谁？

1527
01:06:43.200 --> 01:06:43.800
Who is Alan?
艾伦是谁？

1528
01:06:43.840 --> 01:06:44.620
Who is this guy?
这家伙是谁？

1529
01:06:44.900 --> 01:06:46.080
Who the hell is Alan?
艾伦到底是谁？

1530
01:06:46.440 --> 01:06:48.060
I don't know who Alan is.
我不知道艾伦是谁。

1531
01:06:48.180 --> 01:06:49.460
But Alan's in charge.
但艾伦是负责人。

1532
01:06:49.780 --> 01:06:50.180
Clearly.
显然是的。

1533
01:06:50.540 --> 01:06:51.680
We never meet Alan.
我们从未见过艾伦。

1534
01:06:51.880 --> 01:06:53.280
I've never heard of Alan before.
我以前从未听说过艾伦。

1535
01:06:53.620 --> 01:06:56.960
Well, Alan, whoever you are, this isn't going to go well.
好吧，艾伦，不管你是谁，这事不会顺利的。

1536
01:06:57.100 --> 01:06:58.560
It's not going to go well, Alan.
这不会顺利的，艾伦。

1537
01:06:58.700 --> 01:06:59.840
It's a terrible idea.
这是个糟糕的主意。

1538
01:07:00.080 --> 01:07:00.500
Terrible idea.
糟糕的主意。

1539
01:07:00.660 --> 01:07:02.360
We'll see how it goes next week, at leaSt.
至少我们下周拭目以待吧。

1540
01:07:02.720 --> 01:07:04.360
It is not going to go well, Alan.
这事不会顺利的，艾伦。

1541
01:07:04.820 --> 01:07:05.440
Sorry to say.
我很遗憾地这么说。

1542
01:07:05.700 --> 01:07:07.300
Well, I love this next moment.
嗯，我喜欢接下来的这个时刻。

1543
01:07:07.540 --> 01:07:11.180
Dwight is going to burst in to make an announcement, right?
德怀特要冲进来宣布个消息，对吧？

1544
01:07:11.440 --> 01:07:11.800
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1545
01:07:12.020 --> 01:07:14.120
What he's discovered in the warehouse.
他在仓库里发现了什么。

1546
01:07:14.500 --> 01:07:20.340
But Michael was already making an announcement that he and Jim will now co-manage the Scranton
但迈克尔已经宣布了他和吉姆将共同管理斯克兰顿

1547
01:07:20.340 --> 01:07:20.940
branch.
分公司。

1548
01:07:21.820 --> 01:07:22.340
Dwight?
德怀特？

1549
01:07:23.320 --> 01:07:26.640
Dwight looks like someone hit him in the face with a frying pan.
德怀特看起来就像被人用平底锅砸了脸一样。

1550
01:07:26.820 --> 01:07:29.180
He's like, what the F?
他就像是，这特么是什么鬼？

1551
01:07:29.440 --> 01:07:31.920
And then he has a talking head that's just a scream.
然后他有一个单人访谈，简直绝了。

1552
01:07:32.220 --> 01:07:34.120
Like a primal scream.
就像一声原始的尖叫。

1553
01:07:34.120 --> 01:07:40.060
We had a fan question from Winter P from Fort Wayne, Indiana, my birthplace.
我们收到了来自印第安纳州韦恩堡的冬妮娅的粉丝提问，那也是我的出生地。

1554
01:07:40.720 --> 01:07:41.920
That's where I was born.
那就是我出生的地方。

1555
01:07:42.080 --> 01:07:42.640
How about that?
厉害吧？

1556
01:07:43.060 --> 01:07:47.380
After Jim gets promoted, Dwight has a talking head where he just screaMs.
在吉姆升职之后，德怀特有一个单人访谈，他在里面放声尖叫。

1557
01:07:47.580 --> 01:07:52.220
And you can see Creed, like, jump out of his seat in the background.
你能看到克里德在背景里吓得从座位上跳了起来。

1558
01:07:52.760 --> 01:07:55.240
Was Creed actually startled by the noise?
克里德真的是被那个声音吓到的吗？

1559
01:07:55.560 --> 01:07:58.080
I mean, I have to say it looked like he was.
我的意思是，不得不说他看起来确实是。

1560
01:07:58.080 --> 01:07:59.920
They might have used the very first take.
他们用的可能是第一条拍摄的素材。

1561
01:08:00.040 --> 01:08:00.200
Yeah.
对。

1562
01:08:00.340 --> 01:08:03.340
And Creed maybe didn't realize how loud rain was going to be.
而且克里德可能没意识到声音会叫得那么大。

1563
01:08:04.440 --> 01:08:07.180
Well, you know, in the shooting draft, that's the last scene.
你知道的，在拍摄剧本里，那才是最后一个场景。

1564
01:08:07.700 --> 01:08:08.100
Oh.
哦。

1565
01:08:08.300 --> 01:08:08.600
Yeah.
是的。

1566
01:08:08.980 --> 01:08:14.740
